5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Welcome, everyone. As we begin, let us remember that while funding is essential, the true heart of research is the people. We must ensure the chosen project has the skilled hands necessary to bring it to fruition.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. Beyond the skills, I think we should also consider the practical feasibility of the budgets. It is important to know if the funding is still sufficient to cover all the necessary operational costs.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I think we should also check if the shared facilities they need are actually available! It would be a shame if a great project got stuck because the equipment was too busy or broken.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A very prudent point, Kenji. I would add that we should investigate where projects in this field typically encounter delays. It would be a pity to fund a masterpiece that remains unfinished due to bureaucratic or logistical friction.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Benjamin. We often trust our instincts on a project's promise, but those can be misleading. We should verify what has actually been delivered in the past to ensure this grant is used effectively.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to be thorough. To ensure the human element is secure, I shall look into the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength. Who else has decided their focus?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I will look into the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers, as well as the national computing agreement and facility day rates. I want to see how costs are currently being distributed.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation! I want to make sure the tools they need are actually working and not overbooked.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the station records from partner field sites. I am curious to see where the clock typically runs out on these ambitious endeavors.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the closeout files of finished awards and the national repository deposit turnaround. I want to see which types of projects actually deliver their results on time.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By examining both the physical tools and the human spirit behind the work, we shall find a path that leads to genuine success.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I think this approach covers all the bases. By looking at both the human resources and the financial realities, we can make a decision that is fair and sustainable for the researcher.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm just excited to see what we find! If we make sure the facilities are ready to go, the researchers can focus on the fun part—the actual science!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Kenji. There is a certain elegance in a project that glides forward without the indignity of avoidable delays. I look forward to seeing if our findings reveal any systemic pitfalls we should avoid.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Consistency is key. I hope the data reveals a clear pattern of delivery, allowing us to move beyond mere intuition and base our final decision on proven reliability.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us proceed with a spirit of openness and patience. I look forward to our next gathering, where we shall weave these separate threads of information into a complete picture for the benefit of the science.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I look forward to it as well. I hope the information I find will help us ensure the awardee can truly focus on their research without being overwhelmed by hidden costs. See you all soon.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Kenji,,See you guys! I'll be rooting for the project that has the best setup to actually get things done. Let's hope the equipment is in great shape!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Until then. I shall enjoy the quiet anticipation of discovering which logistical ghosts are currently haunting our field. Safe travels to all, and I shall see you in the next round.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will be waiting. Let us hope the records provide the objectivity we need to avoid past mistakes. I look forward to seeing how your findings align with the historical data.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
